      "message": "that is a good point, I have changed the code to instead call a method to check if resource shrinking is on which it is if either of the flags is set to true. This will give us:\nshrink_resources \u003d false + optimized_shrink_resources \u003d false \u003d off\nshrink_resources \u003d true + optimized_shrink_resources \u003d false \u003d normal resource shrinking\nshrink_resources \u003d false + optimized_shrink_resources \u003d true \u003d optimized resource shrinking\nshrink_resources \u003d true + optimized_shrink_resources \u003d true \u003d optimized resource shrinking\nwhich is what I think we want as defaults here, let me know if this is not the normal way to do this in soong?",
